{"seq":1,"slug":"swine-production","title":"大学动物科学 — 现代养猪生产体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/animal-science/livestock-production-management/swine-production","wordCount":1702,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学动物科学-现代养猪生产体系\">大学动物科学 — 现代养猪生产体系</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>中国是世界第一养猪大国，年出栏生猪约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span></span></span></span></span> 亿头，养猪业是中国畜牧业的&quot;压舱石&quot;。现代养猪早已不是农户院子里散养几头那么简单，而是一套高度专业化、流程化的工业生产体系：从配种、妊娠、分娩、保育到育肥，每个环节都有专门的猪舍、专门的饲料和专门的管理规程。理解这套体系，是把前三章的解剖、营养、遗传知识落地到真实生产的关键。</p>\n<p>本节将带你走完一头猪&quot;从配种到出栏&quot;的完整生命周期，理解现代猪场的&quot;全进全出&quot;&quot;批次化生产&quot;等核心管理理念，以及衡量猪场效率的关键指标。你会看到，养猪本质上是一座以母猪为核心、追求&quot;年提供更多健壮断奶仔猪&quot;的生产工厂。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一头猪的生命周期\">一头猪的生命周期</h3><p>现代养猪按生理阶段把猪群分群、分舍管理，形成一条清晰的生产流水线：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[配种&lt;br/&gt;后备/经产母猪] --&gt; B[妊娠 114天]&#10;    B --&gt; C[分娩哺乳&lt;br/&gt;21-28天]&#10;    C --&gt; D[保育&lt;br/&gt;断奶至70日龄]&#10;    D --&gt; E[育肥&lt;br/&gt;至110-120kg]&#10;    E --&gt; F[出栏上市&lt;br/&gt;约170-180日龄]\">flowchart LR\n    A[配种&lt;br/&gt;后备/经产母猪] --&gt; B[妊娠 114天]\n    B --&gt; C[分娩哺乳&lt;br/&gt;21-28天]\n    C --&gt; D[保育&lt;br/&gt;断奶至70日龄]\n    D --&gt; E[育肥&lt;br/&gt;至110-120kg]\n    E --&gt; F[出栏上市&lt;br/&gt;约170-180日龄]</pre><p>整个周期约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span> 个月：母猪配种后妊娠 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>114</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">114</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">114</span></span></span></span></span> 天产仔，仔猪哺乳 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\text{-}4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 周后断奶进入保育舍，再转入育肥舍长到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>110</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">110\\text{-}120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">110</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span> 公斤出栏。母猪则在仔猪断奶后很快再次发情配种，进入下一个繁殖周期。</p>\n<h3 id=\"以母猪为核心-psy-这个关键指标\">以母猪为核心：PSY 这个关键指标</h3><p>现代养猪的效率，集中体现在母猪的繁殖成绩上。最核心的指标是 <strong>PSY（每头母猪每年提供的断奶仔猪数，Pigs per Sow per Year）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>PSY</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>每年胎次</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>每胎断奶仔猪数</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{PSY} = \\text{每年胎次} \\times \\text{每胎断奶仔猪数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PSY</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每年胎次</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">每胎断奶仔猪数</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>举例：一头母猪每年产 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.4</span></span></span></span></span> 胎，每胎断奶 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">11</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11</span></span></span></span></span> 头，则 PSY <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2.4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>26.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 2.4 \\times 11 = 26.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">26.4</span></span></span></span></span>。国际顶尖猪场 PSY 可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 以上，而管理粗放的猪场可能只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18\\text{-}20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span>。这个差距意味着同样养一头母猪，效益相差近一倍——可见母猪繁殖管理是养猪盈利的核心战场。</p>\n<p>提高 PSY 的两条路径清晰可见：一是增加胎次（缩短非生产天数、提高配种受胎率），二是提高每胎断奶数（产活仔多、哺乳期成活率高）。这就把前面学过的繁殖生理、营养、遗传全部串了起来。</p>\n<h3 id=\"全进全出与批次化生产\">全进全出与批次化生产</h3><p>现代猪场两大管理理念值得重点理解：</p>\n<p><strong>全进全出（All-in/All-out）</strong>：同一栋猪舍的猪同时进、同时出，转走后彻底清洗消毒、空置数天再进下一批。这样能切断病原在不同批次间的传播链，是生物安全的基石。如果像老式猪场那样&quot;连续饲养、随进随出&quot;，病原会在猪舍里不断累积，疫病防不胜防。</p>\n<p><strong>批次化生产</strong>：把母猪按发情配种时间分成若干批，每批同期配种、同期分娩、同期断奶。这让生产像工厂的流水线一样有节奏、可计划，便于集中操作、集中防疫，也提高了猪舍和人力的利用率。比如&quot;三周批&quot;&quot;四周批&quot;生产模式，正在中国规模猪场迅速普及。</p>\n<h3 id=\"生物安全-猪场的生命线\">生物安全：猪场的生命线</h3><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2018</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2018</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2018</span></span></span></span></span> 年传入中国的<strong>非洲猪瘟（ASF）<strong>给整个行业上了沉重一课。这种病毒没有疫苗、致死率近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span>，唯一的防线就是</strong>生物安全</strong>——把病原挡在猪场门外。现代猪场为此构筑了多重防线：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>防线层级</th>\n<th>措施</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>选址布局</td>\n<td>远离居民区、道路、其他猪场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人员管理</td>\n<td>进场洗澡换衣、隔离观察</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>车辆管理</td>\n<td>中转站洗消、不进生产区</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物资管理</td>\n<td>饲料、物品消毒后入场</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动物管理</td>\n<td>引种隔离检测、灭鼠灭蝇</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>非洲猪瘟之后，中国养猪业加速向高生物安全的规模化、楼房化猪场转型，行业集中度大幅提升。这是一次惨痛却深刻的产业升级——它让&quot;生物安全&quot;从一句口号变成了决定企业生死的硬约束。</p>\n<h3 id=\"关键生产指标体系\">关键生产指标体系</h3><p>评价一个猪场的经营水平，需要一套量化指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>优秀水平参考</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PSY</td>\n<td>每母猪年断奶仔数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 28</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">28</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>料肉比（FCR）</td>\n<td>增重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> kg 耗料</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.6</span></span></span></span></span> 左右</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>育肥成活率</td>\n<td>育肥阶段存活比例</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>97</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 97\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">97%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上市日龄</td>\n<td>达上市体重的天数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>175</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq 175</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">175</span></span></span></span></span> 天</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中<strong>料肉比</strong>直接关联前面的营养章节——它衡量饲料转化为肉的效率，是除繁殖外最大的成本变量。把这些指标记牢，你就拥有了诊断一个猪场经营好坏的&quot;仪表盘&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>画出一头猪从配种到出栏的完整生命周期，并标注各阶段大致天数。</li>\n<li>什么是 PSY？请用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.3</span></span></span></span></span> 胎/年、每胎断奶 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10.5</span></span></span></span></span> 头计算 PSY，并说明提高 PSY 的两条路径。</li>\n<li>为什么&quot;全进全出&quot;比&quot;连续饲养&quot;更有利于疫病控制？批次化生产又带来了哪些管理优势？</li>\n<li>非洲猪瘟为什么让生物安全成为猪场的&quot;生命线&quot;？列举至少四项核心生物安全措施。</li>\n<li>料肉比这个指标如何把&quot;营养&quot;和&quot;经营&quot;联系起来？为什么它是除繁殖外最大的成本变量？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>了解非洲猪瘟疫情对中国猪价和行业格局的冲击（&quot;超级猪周期&quot;），理解疫病的宏观经济影响。</li>\n<li>查阅&quot;楼房养猪&quot;&quot;智能猪场&quot;的案例（如牧原、扬翔），看现代养猪如何与工程和信息技术融合。</li>\n<li>阅读关于丹麦养猪业（PSY 全球领先）的管理经验，思考差距背后的原因。</li>\n<li>思考&quot;母猪是利润中心&quot;这一理念，与企业管理中&quot;抓核心资源产出&quot;的思想如何相通。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>现代养猪是一套以母猪为核心、追求高效繁殖产出的工业化生产体系。要把握几条主线：猪的生命周期与分阶段饲养、以 PSY 为核心的繁殖效率指标、全进全出与批次化生产的管理理念、以及非洲猪瘟之后生物安全的极端重要性。料肉比等指标把营养与经营紧密相连。这一节让你看到了前三章知识如何在真实猪场中汇聚。下一节，我们将走进另一个高度工业化的领域——家禽生产，看蛋鸡和肉鸡的生产体系。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学动物科学 — 现代养猪生产体系","id":"大学动物科学-现代养猪生产体系"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一头猪的生命周期","id":"一头猪的生命周期"},{"level":3,"text":"以母猪为核心：PSY 这个关键指标","id":"以母猪为核心-psy-这个关键指标"},{"level":3,"text":"全进全出与批次化生产","id":"全进全出与批次化生产"},{"level":3,"text":"生物安全：猪场的生命线","id":"生物安全-猪场的生命线"},{"level":3,"text":"关键生产指标体系","id":"关键生产指标体系"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学动物科学 — 分子育种与基因组技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/animal-science/animal-genetics-breeding/molecular-breeding"},"next":{"title":"大学动物科学 — 家禽生产与禽蛋体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/animal-science/livestock-production-management/poultry-production"}}